uality, image carries slight noise and color bleed, mimicking the fuzzy texture and hue drift from a phone camera’s casual capture, evoking a real, unpolished street portrait style."], "inputs": [{"shape": 7, "name": "anything", "label": "anything", "type": "*", "localized_name": "anything"}], "flags": {}, "index": 3, "id": -1, "type": "easy showAnything", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "easy showAnything"}, "order": 45}, {"outputs": [{"name": "text", "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}, {"name": "image", "label": "image", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image"}], "widgets_values": ["", "", "txt", true], "inputs": [{"name": "text", "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image", "label": "image", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image"}, {"widget": {"name": "output_file_path"}, "name": "output_file_path", "label": "output_file_path", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "output_file_path"}, {"widget": {"name": "file_name"}, "name": "file_name", "label": "file_name", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "file_name"}, {"widget": {"name": "file_extension"}, "name": "file_extension", "label": "file_extension", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "file_extension"}, {"widget": {"name": "overwrite"}, "name": "overwrite", "label": "overwrite", "type": "BOOLEAN", "localized_name": "overwrite"}], "flags": {}, "index": 4, "type": "easy saveText", "title": "输出=文本", "mode": 0, "size": [270, 150], "pos": [-2184.431884765625, 742.7396240234375], "id": -1, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "easy saveText"}, "order": 51}], "widgets_values": ["Huihui-Qwen3-VL-8B-Instruct-abliterated.Q8_0.gguf", "Huihui-Qwen3-VL-8B-Instruct-abliterated.mmproj-Q8_0.gguf", "Qwen3-VL", 8192, -1, 0, 0, "688f83fe15790135bb8faa1e34f3f5d38e75e6a57d0a4034d0f81c58d744a2b0.png", "image", 152815554701052, "randomize", false, false, "Normal - Describe", "你是一位专业的AI图像生成提示词工程师。请详细